Z||000007||Oreif||04-17-2000||11:27 PM||||YEAH! I remember the "Bond" style commercial too! I think that was 86 when the fastback body style first came out.||||reg||1
Z||000008||Bald Dude||04-19-2000||03:15 PM||||I seem to remember one where there was a young girl in a red fastback GT talking to a cop.  The cop was asking about the car.  I don't remember any others.  <P>I wonder if Pontiac Marketing has any of those old commercials available.  They were pretty quick in replying when I ask about bringing back the Fiero.  Maybe one of us should e-mail Pontiac and ask about the commercials.||||reg||1
